{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Observation\n\nAGENTS.md says `make test` \"selects exactly what CI's gating `ubuntu-latest, py3.13` cell selects\". The selection markers match, but the installed packages do not:\n- CI's gating pytest job installs `uv sync --locked --extra dev --extra reviewbot --extra ui --extra grounding-terraform` (.github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml, line 495).\n- `make install` runs `uv sync --locked --extra dev --extra metrics` (Makefile, line 101).\n\nTests guarded by `pytest.importorskip(\"fastapi\")` and similar are therefore skipped locally and only run in CI. On 2026-10-29, `make verify` passed on Gerrit 3141 (19,819 passed, 88 skipped) while CI failed `tests/unit/test_review_bot.py::test_lifespan_drains_queued_events_on_shutdown`, which `make verify` had skipped because the worktree venv had no fastapi.\n\nvampiric-dollfaced-aurochs fixed the CI side of this (no lane installed the reviewbot extra); the local install was not aligned.\n\n## Plan\n1. In the Makefile, name the extras once (a `TEST_EXTRAS` variable holding `reviewbot ui grounding-terraform`) and have `install` sync `dev metrics` plus those, and `install-unlocked` install the same set. `make worktree` provisions through `make install`, so it follows.\n2. Add a test that parses the gating pytest job's `uv sync` line in `.github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml` and the Makefile's `TEST_EXTRAS`, and fails when they differ.\n3. Rewrite the `docs/local-dev-env.md` section \"Running the tests CI runs\": it currently says `make install` deliberately stays lean and skips ~38 tests, which contradicts AGENTS.md's statement that `make verify` is the locally checkable half of Verified.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] A test compares the extras `make install` syncs with the gating pytest cell's extras and fails when they differ.\n- [ ] After `make install`, `python -c \"import fastapi\"` succeeds in the venv.\n- [ ] `make verify` in a freshly provisioned worktree reports fewer skips than 88, and none from a missing reviewbot, ui or grounding-terraform package.\n\n## File impact (expected)\n- Makefile\n- tests/unit/ (new parity test)\n- docs/local-dev-env.md"}},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1793321108268327001,"uuid":"d228bdde-38b5-4ab7-9003-cfe98d091254"}